    "content": "لتكن العبارتان $D$ و $E$ حيث:",
    "formulas": [
      "D = (x - \\sqrt{2})(4x + 3) - (x + 2)(x - \\sqrt{2})",
      "E = (2 - 5x)\\left(x - \\dfrac{2}{3}\\right) + (2 - 5x)\\left(x - \\dfrac{4}{3}\\right)"
    ]
  },
